TCuFlow
Copyright 2026 TCuFlow contributors
https://github.com/tcuber11/tcu-flow

TCuFlow is based on LOKA by Aufa Nirsad (https://github.com/fanrsd/LOKA),
imported at upstream commit 8403987 (LOKA 0.9.5). TCuFlow changes:
- renamed the product, binary, app identifier and update/release links to TCuFlow;
- changed the QUIC ALPN (tcuflow/1) and ports (UDP 53418, TCP 53419-53421) so
  TCuFlow and LOKA do not pair with or block each other;
- refuses remote terminal, folder, sound, microphone and notification sharing,
  and hides their controls.
Source files changed by TCuFlow carry a "Modified for TCuFlow" header; files that
have no header (package.json, tauri.conf.json, tauri.macos.conf.json,
index.html, Info.plist) were
changed only as listed above. The full history is in this repository's git log.
